      "1903"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "A plant-derived protein diet increased digestible energy and dry matter digestibility in maned wolves compared to supplemented animal-based protein diets.",
    "citations": [
      "1903"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "A plant-derived protein diet decreased mineral retention and plasma taurine in maned wolves compared to supplemented animal-based protein diets.",
    "citations": [
      "1903"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "Allocating fast days is an alternative feeding strategy for carnivores.",
